  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Sino-Norwegian Emissions Trading System Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to support the establishment and operation of China&#x2019;s national carbon emission trading system, and thus contribute to cost-effective reduction of greenhouse gas emissions in China. It is implemented by Department of Climate Change under China&#x2019;s Ministry of Ecology and Environment, with technical assistance from Norwegian Environment Agency.</narrative>
  </description>
